⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Estark
node ARN · ARN · ⟦Estark:ARN:bc0e77⟧

WHO   — Estark — the city of the Houses
WHAT  — The setting and the prize: a corrupt city-state whose order Garth comes to break, later placed on the plane of Dominaria.
WHERE — ARN · Arena  Framework inputs: Arena (Forstchen, 1994)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the Western needs its town — the rotten place the stranger rides into and leaves changed.
HOW   — By the rule of the Houses, the spectacle of the Arena, and a corruption ripe for a stranger's match.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am the city the Houses bled — corrupt, gilded, and proud — until a one-eyed stranger came to Festival and set my powers against each other.

